WEBVTT

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:13.180
Romeo's Blue Skies

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:13.180
TAKARA FANSUBS

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:12.830
"To the Sky..."

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.580
Overlooking the rows of houses and stores

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:21.280
from the highest vantage,

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:26.780
Such things as tears and sadness

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:30.680
will quickly vanish

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:36.880
The birds, wind, and sunshine...

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:40.880
...all are your friends

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:45.790
I'll carry this dream farther than far

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:50.390
...no matter the distance...

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:57.590
I long to fly freely

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:01.790
through the blue sky in my heart...

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:04.690
The far distant blue sky

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:12.190
It flows into tomorrow

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:35.380
Romeo and Alfredo were sold to work as chimney-sweeps.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:38.380
Then they were separated from each other.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:45.080
A man named Rossi bought Romeo.

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:51.080
In Rossi's house, Romeo's life in Milan began.

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:56.080
Episode 8:

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:56.080
A Gift from an Angel

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:29.580
That jerk.

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:47.380
The angel's song I heard last night came from that room for sure.

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:20.880
Why you little sneak!

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:23.380
When did you steal this key?

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:28.580
What a detestable child, sneaking around all over the place.

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:30.780
I didn't steal it!

00:03:30.880 --> 00:03:32.980
It was lying here on the ground!

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:34.480
You rogue!

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:38.880
Probably scheming behind our backs, intending to get a good laugh out of it, eh?

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:40.480
That's not true, I--

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:41.980
Shut your mouth!

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.680
If you've got time for such mischief...

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:47.380
...then you can just clean the whole house!

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:48.580
Do you hear me?

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:51.980
Take this and this and get to work!

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:11.880
Hasn't that been enough?

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:13.980
How about giving him a little something to eat?

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:16.480
Er, never mind...

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:19.780
Be kind to them and they'll ride you for all you're worth.

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:25.180
If he thinks he's going to have it easy here, he'll soon see his error.

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:27.780
Quit collecting dust!

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:35.480
Mom, I'm full.

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:36.480
Oh really?

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:39.780
You don't have to force yourself to finish it if you don't want to.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:41.180
Thank you!

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:43.280
So, I'll just give this to Palmo.

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:49.280
Here ya go, Palmo.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:55.880
Like that, Palmo?

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:00.780
Dammit!

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:03.580
I haven't done anything wrong!

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:07.980
You believe me.

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:10.580
Don't you?

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:16.680
And surely, Alfredo also.

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:32.080
We'll reach Milan tomorrow.

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:34.680
What's going to happen to us?

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:51.780
When I was feeling low, Bianca always used to tell me...

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:53.080
What would she say?

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.830
"There's only one day like today in your entire life."

00:05:57.680 --> 00:05:59.480
"When all else fails, keep living."

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.080
So... Keep your spirits up and things'll turn out okay.

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:05.080
High spirits... things will be okay.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.680
And when you can't keep your spirits up...

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:11.180
When you can't keep them up...?

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:12.780
Just do this.

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:23.180
So? Feel better, don'tcha?

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:24.980
Yeah!

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:25.980
All right!

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:37.380
High spirits... things will be okay!

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:38.780
All right!

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:42.880
So what's there to complain about?

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:13.080
Hey Romeo!

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.480
Boss, I finished the cleaning.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.180
You did?

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:21.980
Time to leave for work soon.

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:23.830
Yes sir!

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:40.780
You're a strange one!

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:44.230
Well, I thought...

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:46.480
Frankly, I thought you'd be more depressed!

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:48.580
I am depressed, a little.

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:52.280
But walking around with a sour face doesn't do any good!

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:56.780
I see.

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:59.480
Put all that out of your head, and get ready.

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:02.880
This street is our territory--
Mantsuoni Street.

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:10.480
Spatza camino!

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:12.680
"Spatza camino"

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:15.080
"Would you like your chimney cleaned?"

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:19.880
This was the call of the chimney-sweep.

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.380
Don't just watch, do like me.

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:23.580
Me too?

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:28.080
Spatza camino! We'll make your chimney beautiful!

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:32.980
Okay.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:37.380
Spatza...

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:38.980
Louder, louder!

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:42.100
Shout it out from the bottom of your lungs.

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:43.180
Right...

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:44.580
Spatza cami...

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:46.380
Are you talking in your sleep or something?

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:49.580
Gimme a bellow loud enough to reach all the way back to your village!

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:51.880
Here goes...

00:08:56.180 --> 00:09:00.180
Spatza camino!

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:12.580
Please, Mr. chimney-sweep!

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:14.680
Great! We've got a job!

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:37.980
Over here, chimney-sweep--
in the kitchen.

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:39.480
Okay!

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:49.580
Well then, what seems to be the problem, ma'am?

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:52.880
The smoke won't go out from the chimney, it's just awful.

00:09:54.680 --> 00:09:58.280
The soot will have to be thoroughly cleaned away.

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:00.180
What're you just standing there for? Come here.

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:01.280
Yes sir!

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:04.180
Grab a brush and take off your jacket.

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:05.980
Yes sir.

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:13.180
Okay, get in the fireplace.

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:14.380
Do what?

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:15.880
Use your head!

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:18.180
Obviously, I can't fit in there!

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:19.780
Hurry up!

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:20.580
Yes sir!

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:24.680
He's just a beginner.

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:26.980
This is his first job.

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:29.180
You WILL clean it well, I hope...

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:30.780
But of course.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:34.980
So, let's do it! Up the ladder!

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:43.180
Hurry up!

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:44.480
Yes sir!

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:50.580
I'm up.

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:53.480
Very good, now there should be an iron handle somewhere...

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:00.680
Did you find the handle?

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:03.980
Found it.

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:06.180
Use that to climb up.

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:08.880
Grab the second, the third... all the way up.

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:13.880
And once I'm at the top?

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:16.180
Look for another hole.

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:18.780
It leads to a large chimney.

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:20.980
If you find it, punch the hole.

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:32.880
Close your eyes when you move and don't worry if soot falls down!

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:48.580
What're you doing?

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:52.680
It stings my eyes---
and I can't breathe.

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:53.880
Breath through your nose!

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:56.580
Once you get used to it soot'll smell like perfume to you.

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:58.380
And you call yourself a man?

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:03.080
I'll go again.

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:05.180
Good, that's the spirit.

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:26.080
Did you find the hole?

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:27.180
Not yet.

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:28.580
Climb higher!

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:39.080
Keep climbing! Punch that hole when you find it!

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:47.480
Keep your spirits up and things'll turn out okay.

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:49.880
Keep you spirits up and things'll...

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.980
Found the hole!

00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:22.530
Thank you, about how much will it be?

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:26.330
Yes ma'am, that will be one lira, please.

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:29.430
Spatza camino!

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:33.030
Spatza camino!

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:39.130
Pull yourself together... what happened to all that energy you had earlier?

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:42.130
I've still got energy...

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:46.730
Spatza camino!

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.330
Hey!

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:51.430
Boss, over here, would ya?

00:13:53.530 --> 00:13:54.730
I brought 'em.

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.830
What's the problem?

00:13:57.830 --> 00:13:59.430
It must be clogged...

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:02.430
Smoke, fumes... it all just comes back out.

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:03.730
Please have a look.

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:05.530
Leave it to us.

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:09.780
Come on, Romeo.

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:10.930
Yes sir.

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:25.830
How long ago did you put out the fire?

00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:26.830
Just a while ago.

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:29.530
Well then, we can't do anything yet. We'll just get burned.

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:31.230
I don't have time!

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:35.030
My kid's got a bread delivery to make before one o'clock.

00:14:35.030 --> 00:14:36.430
Please, do it quickly!

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:44.030
I'll pay double.

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:44.430
Double!

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:47.730
How 'bout it? Will you take the job?

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.530
Get in.

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:56.130
G'wan, get inside.

00:14:56.130 --> 00:14:57.030
In THERE?

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:06.430
Get in!

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:09.430
Here goes...

00:15:10.530 --> 00:15:11.830
Ahh--hot!

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:14.030
Just a second.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:19.530
Use this.

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:20.430
Okay.

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:26.130
The chimney can't be that high.
I'll bet a brick is dislodged.

00:15:43.230 --> 00:15:45.030
God it's hot.

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:55.430
Oh thank goodness, you came to!

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:57.330
Are you okay?

00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:58.630
Yeah.

00:16:01.130 --> 00:16:05.230
Now get up! We ain't done yet-- you're climbing up again!

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:17.830
It was a sky so deeply blue that it seemed to singe the eyes.

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:22.730
Romeo felt as if he were in the middle of the sky.

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:27.630
The city, the clouds, all belonged to him.

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:34.430
On the rooftops... was a world into which no adults could intrude.

00:17:34.730 --> 00:17:38.330
A world of the chimney sweeps alone.

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:50.830
Boss...

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:55.330
Oh, there you are...
Sorry for the wait.

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:57.730
You sure knocked 'em down, didn't you...

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.130
Hey Romeo!

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:02.430
You did a bang-up job today.

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:08.130
You sure showed a lot of grit for the very first day.

00:18:12.330 --> 00:18:14.430
What, are you hungry?

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:17.330
Well I haven't eaten a thing since last night!

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:22.030
All right, I'll have the wife fix you up a big meal.

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:26.230
You did more than your share of work today.

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.430
Really?

00:18:30.930 --> 00:18:35.930
"Hellish or not, we'll tumble right in."

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:41.230
"That's the lot of the chimney sweep!"

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:45.930
I'm home!

00:18:46.030 --> 00:18:47.730
You've been drinking again, haven't you?

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:50.430
Why, as a matter of fact...

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:54.830
Why didn't you stop him?

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:57.730
He just drinks away our precious money.

00:18:58.030 --> 00:18:59.030
I...

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:00.830
What an unbelievable dullard you are!

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:04.130
If you were more alert this wouldn't have happened!

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:09.430
We can't budge him an inch when he gets like this.

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:10.930
Excuse me...

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:13.330
Please give me some dinner.

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:16.530
I haven't eaten since last night and I'm starving.

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:19.930
I heard from Carlo the baker earlier...

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:25.030
You choked on a little soot, passed out and were no help at all.

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:29.030
That's not true. I did pass out, but afterwards I finished my job.

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:34.330
No more wine, thanks...

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:37.930
The world is full of 'em.

00:19:38.230 --> 00:19:42.430
Fellows who don't sweat a drop at work but come running for handouts.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:46.830
I can't believe this. Off he goes and spends eighty-five lira, and for what?

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:50.230
This useless, lazy worm!

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:54.030
But if it were me, I'd be working as hard as I could.

00:19:54.030 --> 00:19:57.030
What an adorable child!

00:19:57.130 --> 00:20:00.030
There's no one as nice as you in the world.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:02.230
Now, go and shut that boy up in his room, okay?

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:03.130
Yes, mother.

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:20.630
I can't let it get me down.

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:33.430
Alfredo...

00:20:40.430 --> 00:20:42.530
When you can't even keep your spirits up...

00:20:42.930 --> 00:20:44.730
...then what do you do?

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:52.830
What is it, Piccolo?

00:21:00.430 --> 00:21:02.630
Is there something in here?

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:08.230
Bread and cheese!

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:10.730
This is...

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:26.330
...a gift from the angel!

00:21:55.430 --> 00:21:57.730
Professor Casera is very kind.

00:21:58.230 --> 00:22:00.030
He taught me how to write!

00:22:00.430 --> 00:22:04.030
I wrote my first letter with the letters I learned.

00:22:04.430 --> 00:22:07.430
Right, I'm going off to deliver it... to the angel!

00:22:08.130 --> 00:22:11.330
Next time:
A Love Letter, in the Moonlight
See you then!

00:22:12.980 --> 00:22:16.980
"Si Si Ciao ~ On These Roman Roofs"

00:22:25.680 --> 00:22:29.780
Si Si Ciao, why do the good times

00:22:29.880 --> 00:22:34.080
seem to end so soon?

00:22:34.280 --> 00:22:38.280
Si Si Ciao, we're all friends

00:22:38.480 --> 00:22:42.480
Let's meet again on these Roman roofs

00:22:43.090 --> 00:22:47.390
Your laughing voice dances

00:22:47.390 --> 00:22:51.290
Once again in the sky

00:22:51.690 --> 00:22:58.590
Your pocket bursting with memories

00:23:00.290 --> 00:23:04.190
Si Si Ciao, goodbye but for now

00:23:04.390 --> 00:23:08.390
Let's meet again on these Roman roofs
